{"id":"3c34288b-a88f-4663-8554-3005736ea909","object":"chat.completion","created":1794555021,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n:root{\n  --bg:#F5F2E9;\n  --ink:#1B2620;\n  --muted:#5C665D;\n  --primary:#4F5E43;\n  --gold:#B4914A;\n  --blue:#8C9FB2;\n  --line:#A3AC9E;\n  --serif:\"Songti SC\",\"SimSun\",Georgia,serif;\n  --sans:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"Hiragino Sans GB\",Arial,sans-serif;\n}\nhtml,body{width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg)}\n.slide{\n  position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;\n  background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--sans);\n}\n/* ---------- background layers ---------- */\n.bg-field{\n  position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(1150px 820px at 4% 2%,rgba(180,145,74,.10),transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(900px 780px at 52% 48%,rgba(140,159,178,.11),transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(980px 780px at 96% 96%,rgba(79,94,67,.11),transparent 72%),\n    linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%);\n}\n.bg-field:after{\n  content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.04) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);\n}\n.dot-field{position:absolute;z-index:1;opacity:.34;\n  background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px,transparent 1.15px);\n  background-size:15px 15px;}\n.dot-top{left:1180px;top:0;width:520px;height:130px}\n.dot-bottom{left:700px;top:838px;width:940px;height:242px;opacity:.2}\n\n/* prisms */\n.prism{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:1120px;top:-300px;width:200px;height:1700px;transform:rotate(17deg);\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(140,159,178,.22),rgba(140,159,178,.07) 72%,rgba(140,159,178,0));}\n.prism:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:112px;top:0;width:74px;height:1700px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.42)}\n.prism-gold{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:1260px;top:-200px;width:64px;height:1600px;transform:rotate(17deg);\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(180,145,74,.20),rgba(180,145,74,.04) 70%,rgba(180,145,74,0));}\n\n/* grid lines */\n.gridline{position:absolute;z-index:2;background:rgba(27,38,32,.06)}\n.gl1{left:480px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n.gl2{left:960px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n.gl3{left:1440px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n\n/* structural rules */\n.top-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:64px;width:1728px;height:1px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34)}\n.left-rule{position:absolute;left:60px;top:56px;width:1px;height:968px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.26)}\n.rail-tick{position:absolute;left:54px;width:13px;height:1px;z-index:7;background:rgba(27,38,32,.42)}\n.t1{top:330px}.t2{top:624px}.t3{top:120px}\n.rail-label{\n  position:absolute;left:42px;top:590px;width:360px;z-index:15;\n  transform:rotate(-90deg);transform-origin:left top;\n  font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:5.4px;color:#637067;white-space:nowrap;\n}\n.top-meta{position:absolute;left:98px;top:78px;z-index:15;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4.4px;color:#4f5b53}\n.top-meta-cn{position:absolute;right:98px;top:78px;z-index:15;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:3.4px;color:#6a756b}\n\n/* top-right register */\n.register{position:absolute;right:-64px;top:-96px;width:300px;height:300px;z-index:4;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.34)}\n.register .r2{position:absolute;inset:11px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18)}\n.register .r3{position:absolute;inset:27px;border-radius:50%;\n  background:conic-gradient(from 210deg,rgba(79,94,67,.20),rgba(79,94,67,0) 24%,rgba(140,159,178,.30) 50%,rgba(140,159,178,.08) 78%,rgba(79,94,67,.20));}\n.register .r4{position:absolute;inset:37px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,242,233,.9);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08)}\n.register .r5{position:absolute;inset:54px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(140,159,178,.25);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.09)}\n\n/* ---------- content ---------- */\n.content{position:absolute;left:150px;top:196px;z-index:20;width:1120px}\n\n.eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-bottom:40px}\n.eyebrow .bar{width:56px;height:3px;background:var(--gold)}\n.eyebrow .txt{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:var(--primary)}\n\nh1.main-title{\n  font-family:var(--serif);\n  font-size:112px;line-height:1.14;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;\n  color:#18211C;\n}\n.title-line{position:relative;display:block}\n.title-line em{\n  font-style:normal;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 66%,rgba(180,145,74,.30) 66%,rgba(180,145,74,.30) 90%,transparent 90%);\n}\n\n.subtitle{\n  margin-top:36px;\n  font-size:29px;line-height:1.7;font-weight:500;color:#3F4A42;\n  letter-spacing:1.2px;\n}\n.subtitle .sep{color:var(--gold);padding:0 10px;font-weight:700}\n\n.rule-mid{width:520px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.30);margin:44px 0 0}\n\n.scope-row{display:flex;gap:0;margin-top:38px}\n.scope-item{\n  position:relative;padding:0 44px 0 24px;\n  border-left:2px solid rgba(79,94,67,.45);\n}\n.scope-item:first-child{padding-left:0;border-left:none}\n.scope-item .k{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:#7C8579;margin-bottom:10px}\n.scope-item .v{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);letter-spacing:1px}\n.scope-item .v small{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#8A938A;margin-top:7px}\n\n/* date placeholder block bottom-left */\n.meta-block{\n  position:absolute;left:150px;bottom:118px;z-index:20;\n  display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:26px;\n}\n.meta-block .stamp{\n  font-size:15px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4.2px;color:#6A756B;\n}\n.meta-block .dash{width:120px;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.35);margin-bottom:9px}\n.meta-block .date{\n  font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.4px;color:#4E594F;\n  border:1px dashed rgba(79,94,67,.55);border-radius:3px;padding:9px 20px;\n  background:#FAF7EE;\n}\n\n/* right info card — opaque layered surface */\n.side-card{\n  position:absolute;right:132px;top:300px;z-index:20;width:470px;\n  background:#FAF7EF;\n  background-image:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.72),rgba(243,240,231,.92));\n  border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);\n  border-top:3px solid var(--primary);\n  padding:38px 40px 34px;\n  box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(27,38,32,.07),0 2px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.7) inset;\n}\n.side-card .card-label{\n  font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:5px;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:22px;\n}\n.side-card .card-title{\n  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:33px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.45;color:#1B2620;letter-spacing:1px;\n}\n.side-card .card-rule{width:100%;height:1px;background:rgba(27,38,32,.20);margin:26px 0 24px}\n.side-card p{\n  font-size:19px;line-height:1.95;color:#4A554C;letter-spacing:.7px;\n}\n.side-card p b{color:var(--primary);font-weight:700}\n.tag-list{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin-top:24px}\n.tag{\n  font-size:15px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#4F5E43;\n  border:1px solid rgba(79,94,67,.42);border-radius:2px;\n  padding:7px 14px;background:rgba(79,94,67,.06);\n}\n\n/* disclaimer strip */\n.disclaimer{\n  position:absolute;right:132px;bottom:118px;z-index:20;width:470px;\n  border-left:3px solid var(--gold);padding:14px 0 14px 18px;\n  font-size:16px;line-height:1.8;color:#6C766C;letter-spacing:.8px;\n}\n\n/* decorative corner glyph */\n.corner-num{\n  position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:36px;z-index:9;\n  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:150px;line-height:1;font-weight:700;\n  color:rgba(27,38,32,.055);letter-spacing:-4px;user-select:none;\n}\n\n/* page number */\n.page-no{\n  position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:56px;z-index:30;\n  font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3.4px;color:#5C665D;\n}\n.page-no .slash{color:var(--gold);padding:0 6px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-bottom\"></div>\n  <div class=\"prism\"></div>\n  <div class=\"prism-gold\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"gridline gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl3\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">CHENGTU · TICKETING CLOUD · 内部介绍材料</div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">澄图工单云</div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta-cn\">虚构测评资料 · 不外发</div>\n\n  <div class=\"register\">\n    <div class=\"r2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r4\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r5\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">\n      <div class=\"bar\"></div>\n      <div class=\"txt\">产品介绍 · 企业市场与客户成功团队</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h1 class=\"main-title\">\n      <span class=\"title-line\">澄图工单云</span>\n      <span class=\"title-line\"><em>产品介绍</em></span>\n    </h1>\n\n    <div class=\"subtitle\">\n      面向企业市场与客户成功团队的内部介绍材料<span class=\"sep\">/</span>资料范围：产品能力、试点数据、实施步骤\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rule-mid\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"scope-row\">\n      <div class=\"scope-item\">\n        <div class=\"k\">PART 01</div>\n        <div class=\"v\">产品能力<small>三项核心功能</small></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"scope-item\">\n        <div class=\"k\">PART 02</div>\n        <div class=\"v\">试点数据<small>测评构造值</small></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"scope-item\">\n        <div class=\"k\">PART 03</div>\n        <div class=\"v\">实施步骤<small>四步推进</small></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-card\">\n    <div class=\"card-label\">本册说明</div>\n    <div class=\"card-title\">一本只讲<br/>资料里有的内容</div>\n    <div class=\"card-rule\"></div>\n    <p>全部内容基于<b>虚构测评资料</b>，不含外部补充事实；资料未给出的排期、预算、认证与经营成果，一律不写入。</p>\n    <div class=\"tag-list\">\n      <div class=\"tag\">客户问题</div>\n      <div class=\"tag\">产品能力</div>\n      <div class=\"tag\">试点数据</div>\n      <div class=\"tag\">实施步骤</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"meta-block\">\n    <div class=\"stamp\">汇报日期</div>\n    <div class=\"dash\"></div>\n    <div class=\"date\">待补充</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"disclaimer\">\n    全部数字为虚构测评构造值，仅用于评测演示，不代表真实经营效果。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"corner-num\">01</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\">1<span class=\"slash\">/</span>6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"I need to output the full HTML document with backdrop-filter removed. Keep the title \"澄图工单云产品介绍\" and three key points unchanged.\n\nThe current version's title is split into two lines \"澄图工单云\" and \"产品介绍\" — that's fine, still reads as the title. But instruction says keep cover title 「澄图工单云产品介绍」及三条要点不变. The three bullets: 面向企业市场与客户成功团队的内部介绍材料 / 资料范围：产品能力、试点数据、实施步骤 / 全部内容基于虚构测评资料，不含外部补充事实. Those are present (subtitle, scope row, side card p). Keep them.\n\nRemove backdrop-filter: in .side-card. Replace with semi-transparent solid color e.g. background:rgba(250,248,242,.92) or solid #F7F4EA. Let's use rgba(250,248,241,.94).\n\nAlso no other backdrop-filter uses. Let me check — only .side-card. Good.\n\nEnsure no external resources. Output only the HTML.\n\nLet me slightly refine the card to be opaque with subtle layering.\n\nOutput."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9911,"completion_tokens":4017,"total_tokens":13928,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":5888},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":241},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":5888,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4023},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}